WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:04.990
Hybrid AI architecture combines local and cloud resources so each workload runs where its

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:06.500
requirements are best satisfied.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Local systems offer control, privacy, and low network latency.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Cloud GPUs and hosted models offer temporary scale and specialized capability.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.460
Neither environment is inherently correct for every task.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:21.495
Place work through explicit decisions about data sensitivity, latency, model capability,

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:23.235
volume, availability, and cost.

00:00:23.235 --> 00:00:26.434
Patterns such as local-first fallback, private local preprocessing,

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:28.890
split retrieval and generation, cloud burst jobs,

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:32.970
and edge inference are useful only when interfaces and boundaries are documented.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.455
Fallback must respect policy;

00:00:34.455 --> 00:00:37.456
some requests should stop instead of moving to an unauthorized route.

00:00:37.456 --> 00:00:41.970
Map data, metadata, logs, caches, and backups across every trust boundary.

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:46.590
Route only to eligible endpoints, protect credentials, normalize tested API features,

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.660
and control queues, rate limits, and spending.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:52.440
Measure end-to-end user experience and total cost of ownership across both environments.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.250
Reliability requires tested alternatives, not merely additional components.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.995
Operate the system as one service.

00:00:57.995 --> 00:01:02.995
Apply identity, segmentation, patching, monitoring, audit, incident response, backup,

00:01:02.995 --> 00:01:05.500
and rollback to local and cloud components together.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.500
Review provider risk and changing data flows.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.490
The goal is flexible, controlled AI capability without accidental exposure, runaway cost,

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:14.990
or complexity that the team cannot understand and recover.
